   "source": [
    "# Customer Churn Prediction — Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Business Problem:** Identify telecom customers likely to churn so the retention team can proactively engage with them.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** IBM Telco Customer Churn (7,043 customers, 21 features)\n",
    "**Target:** `Churn` (Yes / No)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Workflow:** Data Preparation → EDA → Feature Engineering → Decision Tree Modeling → Evaluation → Interpretation → Saved Pipeline → API\n"
   ]
  },
