   "source": [
    "## 4. Model Development — Decision Tree Classifier\n",
    "\n",
    "We train and compare **three** Decision Tree configurations:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Depth-5, default** — a shallow, easily-interpretable baseline.\n",
    "2. **Deeper + class-balanced** (`max_depth=8`, `min_samples_leaf=20`, `class_weight='balanced'`) — designed to counter the class imbalance and catch more true churners.\n",
    "3. **Shallow, higher min-split** (`max_depth=4`, `min_samples_split=50`) — simpler, more conservative tree.\n"
   ]
  },
